# Kernel-run provenance from `check_attestations.py --emit-evidence`. Produced per run, on the
# machine that has the toolchain; CI uploads it as a build artifact. It is deliberately NOT
# committed -- a checked-in copy would be a stale claim about a run that is over, which is the
# distinction formal/AGENTS.md rule 7 exists to keep.
evidence/
